e gives us a basic  camera and tasks us with helping the  inhabitants of this world after we've  assisted so many a new area opens up  with more people to meet help and take  selfies with eventually you'll be given  a tripod to set up your camera perfectly  and even a horn to startle people and  animals into some strange poses but  you'll need to be quick to capture them  tome will have you snapping images of  bigfoot hiding away and ant going about  their day almost unnoticeable to the  naked eye reviews average at 8 out of 10  making this the best game of the month  and i think it's worth three hours of  your time for that platinum trophy at  least and finally grand blue fantasy  versus a 2.5 d fighter from 2020 it  turns out over 20 million people play  the mobile rpg or watch the anime so  this franchise is massive versus takes  the spirit of street fighter and keeps  it simple using the typical light medium  and heavy attacks and a special two the  real devastating combos happen when  players are trapped in the corner by an  invisible wall that's when controllers  are smashed granblue fantasy versus has  an rpg mode to advance through which  takes about 10 hours to complete that  mode gives us new weapons to find and  unlock and upgrade to make attacks more  powerful all while following an episodic  timeline and minimally animated visuals  grand blue fantasy verses may be a tough  sell but the critics tell us it's a  solid 7.5 out of 10. so will you try it  so did you get to this part of the video  before clicking off if yes thank you  very much do me a favor please be sure  to rate the month in the comments below  and tell me what you're playing for me  i'm playing tom and i'm probably gonna  go back to play eat again what about you  i'm adam you're awesome i'll see you  next time

